OL,3,GNEWSANo timescale for 'wobbly' bridge
OL,4,Areplacement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "wobbly" footbridge that closed
OL,7,Fsuddenly for safety reasons earlier
OL,8,Fthis year will be replaced, a local
OL,9,Fauthority has confirmed.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council shut the
OL,12,FCottesmore footbridge in south Oxford
OL,13,Fin May after it identified concerns
OL,14,Fwith the structure, which links Rose
OL,15,FHill and Iffley.
OL,17,FAfter six months of uncertainty, the
OL,18,Fcouncil has now confirmed the bridge
OL,19,Fwill be replaced, but has not given a
OL,20,Ftimescale for the project.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
